  "description": "Child of C11-336. Depends on R1 and R2 merged. Contract: docs/markdown-viewer-design.md sections Toolbar, Outline, Themes, Typeface, Text size, Open externally; visual contract reader/index.html round 4.\n\nScope: the reader chrome.\n- Toolbar row under the panel bar (counterpart of the browser's address row, c11 void language): far left the outline toggle (SF Symbol sidebar.left, full-contrast ink, pressed state while open, \"outline\" label when room; fixed button width); then file name \u203a current heading path (truncates with ellipsis), then reading progress (`42% \u00b7 9 min left`); gold progress hairline under the row (the surface's one gold accent). Right: fixed-width, always fully visible cluster: find, source, text size (\u2212 readout +, tabular numerals, reserved width), theme menu (mirrors browserThemeModeButton: themes from the registry + Typeface section), open externally (arrow.up.right.square styled exactly like openInExternalBrowserButton, opens the file with the default .md app, tooltip names the app). Controls never jump or clip.\n- Outline: open by default when the effective width fits panel + full column (serif threshold 962 px effective: 272 panel, 28 gap, 630 column, 32 right pad; mono ~866; +222 with margin footnotes), docked so it covers nothing and closing leaves the text where it is; otherwise hidden by default and opens as an overlay. Translucent (backdrop blur), ~120 ms crossfade, no slide; scrollspy position, current section's subheadings, task counts (2/4), type to filter, click jumps and keeps it open, Esc or the toggle closes. \u21e7\u2318O toggles (check KeyboardShortcutSettings for conflicts). The operator's explicit open/hide persists via R2's state model.\n- Find (\u2318F): a quiet bar with match count and next/previous. Source: read-only toggle keeping place.\n- All strings localized (String(localized:defaultValue:)); six-locale translation pass done in this PR.\n\nProof: tagged Atlas build computer-use pass, screenshots at ~560 px and wide, side by side with the prototype; keyboard and toolbar paths for size, theme, typeface, outline, find, source; open-externally.",
